<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's K&amp;H Bank cuts prime rate to 24.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's K&amp;H Bank cuts prime rate to 24.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Kereskedelmi es Hitelbank Rt (K&amp;H Bank) said on Friday that it will reduce its prime lending rate on forint loans to 24.50 percent from 25.50 percent.</p>
<p>The reduction is effective from October 7, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
